<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:03.929" end="00:00:05.949" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:00:07.600" end="00:00:10.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Amy, you will burn the rice with all</p>
<p begin="00:00:09.200" end="00:00:12.500" style="s2">this dancing.</p>
<p begin="00:00:10.700" end="00:00:14.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, the rice and I understand each</p>
<p begin="00:00:12.500" end="00:00:16.600" style="s2">other. It will not burn. It knows I am a</p>
<p begin="00:00:14.600" end="00:00:18.600" style="s2">happy woman.</p>
<p begin="00:00:16.600" end="00:00:20.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come and sit, my daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:00:18.600" end="00:00:21.500" style="s2">Before you go to the studio, I want to</p>
<p begin="00:00:20.000" end="00:00:23.700" style="s2">tell you something.</p>
<p begin="00:00:21.500" end="00:00:25.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, is this one of your speeches?</p>
<p begin="00:00:23.700" end="00:00:27.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It is one of my speeches. Sit down.</p>
<p begin="00:00:25.600" end="00:00:28.900" style="s2">Yesterday I saw two women laughing at</p>
<p begin="00:00:27.300" end="00:00:30.200" style="s2">you in the market. They did not know I</p>
<p begin="00:00:28.900" end="00:00:32.700" style="s2">was behind them.</p>
<p begin="00:00:30.200" end="00:00:33.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I saw them too, daddy. I did not mind.</p>
<p begin="00:00:32.700" end="00:00:35.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:00:33.600" end="00:00:37.000" style="s2">And that is why I am proud of you. But</p>
<p begin="00:00:35.300" end="00:00:38.600" style="s2">listen, the world will always have an</p>
<p begin="00:00:37.000" end="00:00:40.000" style="s2">opinion about your body. It will have an</p>
<p begin="00:00:38.600" end="00:00:42.600" style="s2">opinion about your height, your color,</p>
<p begin="00:00:40.000" end="00:00:43.900" style="s2">your size. Opinions are like wind. They</p>
<p begin="00:00:42.600" end="00:00:45.500" style="s2">pass.</p>
<p begin="00:00:43.900" end="00:00:47.000" style="s2">But your worth is a house, and a house</p>
<p begin="00:00:45.500" end="00:00:48.600" style="s2">that is built well does not shake</p>
<p begin="00:00:47.000" end="00:00:50.300" style="s2">because the wind is blowing.</p>
<p begin="00:00:48.600" end="00:00:52.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And remember, Amy, God did not make a</p>
<p begin="00:00:50.300" end="00:00:54.300" style="s2">mistake when he made you. He made you on</p>
<p begin="00:00:52.100" end="00:00:56.100" style="s2">purpose. Never apologize for the space</p>
<p begin="00:00:54.300" end="00:00:57.100" style="s2">you take in this world. I will remember</p>
<p begin="00:00:56.100" end="00:00:59.100" style="s2">it, mommy.</p>
<p begin="00:00:57.100" end="00:01:00.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. Now go and sew those beautiful</p>
<p begin="00:00:59.100" end="00:01:03.200" style="s2">dresses and leave some rice for your old</p>
<p begin="00:01:00.900" end="00:01:03.200" style="s2">father.</p>
<p begin="00:01:09.500" end="00:01:13.700" style="s2">Grace, one day a man will come.</p>
<p begin="00:01:11.700" end="00:01:14.900" style="s2">Pray that he is worthy of her.</p>
<p begin="00:01:13.700" end="00:01:17.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have been [music] praying since the</p>
<p begin="00:01:14.900" end="00:01:17.800" style="s2">day she was born.</p>
<p begin="00:01:33.011" end="00:01:35.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:01:39.200" end="00:01:44.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not too much, not too little, just</p>
<p begin="00:01:41.600" end="00:01:44.000" style="s2">right.</p>
<p begin="00:01:48.600" end="00:01:51.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good afternoon.</p>
<p begin="00:01:50.000" end="00:01:53.000" style="s2">Please, are you the tailor?</p>
<p begin="00:01:51.300" end="00:01:54.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am. How can I help?</p>
<p begin="00:01:53.000" end="00:01:57.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My tailor traveled, [music]</p>
<p begin="00:01:54.400" end="00:01:59.692" style="s2">and my sleeve chose today to tear.</p>
<p begin="00:01:57.400" end="00:02:02.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sleeves always choose the worst days.</p>
<p begin="00:01:59.692" end="00:02:02.292" style="s2">Give it to me.</p>
<p begin="00:02:04.992" end="00:02:08.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You hum while you work.</p>
<p begin="00:02:07.092" end="00:02:11.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It keeps the cloth happy.</p>
<p begin="00:02:08.992" end="00:02:11.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Does it work?</p>
<p begin="00:02:12.092" end="00:02:16.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at this stitch. It works.</p>
<p begin="00:02:14.692" end="00:02:18.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can I come back on Friday?</p>
<p begin="00:02:16.692" end="00:02:18.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Friday. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:02:33.292" end="00:02:37.492" style="s2">Daniel, you are 32.</p>
<p begin="00:02:35.592" end="00:02:40.592" style="s2">When will you marry?</p>
<p begin="00:02:37.492" end="00:02:42.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When I meet the right person, mummy.</p>
<p begin="00:02:40.592" end="00:02:44.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Every girl I show you is wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:02:42.992" end="00:02:48.092" style="s2">What are you looking for?</p>
<p begin="00:02:44.992" end="00:02:50.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Someone with a good heart. That is all.</p>
<p begin="00:02:48.092" end="00:02:51.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You came back from the tailor smiling.</p>
<p begin="00:02:50.292" end="00:02:53.692" style="s2">Who is she?</p>
<p begin="00:02:51.492" end="00:02:55.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Her name is Amy. She owns Amy&#39;s Fashion</p>
<p begin="00:02:53.692" end="00:02:57.492" style="s2">House. She is calm and kind.</p>
<p begin="00:02:55.992" end="00:02:59.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know that shop.</p>
<p begin="00:02:57.492" end="00:03:00.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The girl is very fat, Daniel.</p>
<p begin="00:02:59.592" end="00:03:01.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How fat?</p>
<p begin="00:03:00.392" end="00:03:02.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Very fat.</p>
<p begin="00:03:01.692" end="00:03:05.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; People will talk.</p>
<p begin="00:03:02.792" end="00:03:07.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uncle, size is not the problem. I only</p>
<p begin="00:03:05.092" end="00:03:07.992" style="s2">care about the heart, and her heart is</p>
<p begin="00:03:07.092" end="00:03:09.692" style="s2">clean.</p>
<p begin="00:03:07.992" end="00:03:10.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A wife must be someone I can proudly</p>
<p begin="00:03:09.692" end="00:03:13.692" style="s2">show to people.</p>
<p begin="00:03:10.992" end="00:03:14.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mummy, a wife is not a decoration.</p>
<p begin="00:03:13.692" end="00:03:16.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hmm.</p>
<p begin="00:03:14.492" end="00:03:16.992" style="s2">We will see.</p>
<p begin="00:03:20.392" end="00:03:24.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A Tales by Amy Production.</p>
<p begin="00:03:27.692" end="00:03:30.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As good as new.</p>
<p begin="00:03:28.692" end="00:03:31.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cannot even see the tear. How much do I</p>
<p begin="00:03:30.792" end="00:03:34.692" style="s2">owe you?</p>
<p begin="00:03:31.392" end="00:03:34.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 2,000 naira only.</p>
<p begin="00:03:37.192" end="00:03:40.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Amy,</p>
<p begin="00:03:38.192" end="00:03:41.292" style="s2">I did not come only for the jacket.</p>
<p begin="00:03:40.092" end="00:03:43.357" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Really?</p>
<p begin="00:03:41.292" end="00:03:44.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, I came to hear you hum again.</p>
<p begin="00:03:43.357" end="00:03:46.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:03:44.592" end="00:03:48.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are a funny man.</p>
<p begin="00:03:46.292" end="00:03:49.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; May I take you for a walk on the beach?</p>
<p begin="00:03:48.492" end="00:03:50.892" style="s2">Just a walk.</p>
<p begin="00:03:49.792" end="00:03:51.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just a walk, you say?</p>
<p begin="00:03:50.892" end="00:03:54.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:03:51.892" end="00:03:54.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:03:56.892" end="00:04:01.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You laugh with your whole body.</p>
<p begin="00:03:59.292" end="00:04:01.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; People say I laugh too loud.</p>
<p begin="00:04:01.392" end="00:04:03.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then those people</p>
<p begin="00:04:01.994" end="00:04:06.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; tired.</p>
<p begin="00:04:03.294" end="00:04:06.094" style="s2">Please do not stop.</p>
<p begin="00:04:10.094" end="00:04:15.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hold [music] it steady.</p>
<p begin="00:04:11.694" end="00:04:15.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It is steady. The needle is not.</p>
<p begin="00:04:19.494" end="00:04:24.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your team cannot defend.</p>
<p begin="00:04:21.694" end="00:04:26.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, [music] my team is still learning.</p>
<p begin="00:04:24.194" end="00:04:26.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He fits here.</p>
<p begin="00:04:28.894" end="00:04:34.494" style="s2">Stand [music] still.</p>
<p begin="00:04:31.094" end="00:04:34.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I could stand still forever.</p>
<p begin="00:04:36.494" end="00:04:39.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daniel,</p>
<p begin="00:04:37.694" end="00:04:40.894" style="s2">you have never said one word about my</p>
<p begin="00:04:39.494" end="00:04:44.494" style="s2">body.</p>
<p begin="00:04:40.894" end="00:04:44.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because it was never the thing I saw.</p>
<p begin="00:04:45.994" end="00:04:50.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I think [music]</p>
<p begin="00:04:47.094" end="00:04:50.194" style="s2">I have found him.</p>
<p begin="00:04:52.694" end="00:04:57.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have come to this house for months.</p>
<p begin="00:04:55.394" end="00:04:59.594" style="s2">What do you want from my daughter?</p>
<p begin="00:04:57.594" end="00:05:02.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To marry her, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:04:59.594" end="00:05:05.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And her size does not trouble you?</p>
<p begin="00:05:02.994" end="00:05:07.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma, the only thing that troubles me is</p>
<p begin="00:05:05.094" end="00:05:09.294" style="s2">that I did not meet her sooner.</p>
<p begin="00:05:07.494" end="00:05:11.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then hear me, young man. I will not ask</p>
<p begin="00:05:09.294" end="00:05:12.794" style="s2">what you own. Money comes and goes. I</p>
<p begin="00:05:11.194" end="00:05:13.694" style="s2">ask only this. Will you protect her</p>
<p begin="00:05:12.794" end="00:05:15.194" style="s2">heart?</p>
<p begin="00:05:13.694" end="00:05:17.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I promise, sir. I will love her as she</p>
<p begin="00:05:15.194" end="00:05:19.294" style="s2">is. Words are the seed.</p>
<p begin="00:05:17.294" end="00:05:22.994" style="s2">Actions are the fruit. I will watch the</p>
<p begin="00:05:19.294" end="00:05:22.994" style="s2">fruit. You will see it, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:05:31.494" end="00:05:37.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why did you stop?</p>
<p begin="00:05:33.194" end="00:05:37.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want to remember this exact moment.</p>
<p begin="00:05:37.794" end="00:05:43.223" style="s2">Amy, you make ordinary days feel like a</p>
<p begin="00:05:39.894" end="00:05:44.094" style="s2">gift. Will you marry me?</p>
<p begin="00:05:43.223" end="00:05:45.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:05:44.094" end="00:05:47.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daniel, all my life I have been</p>
<p begin="00:05:45.894" end="00:05:49.594" style="s2">confident, but I never thought a man</p>
<p begin="00:05:47.594" end="00:05:50.594" style="s2">would look at me and see only me.</p>
<p begin="00:05:49.594" end="00:05:54.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I only see you.</p>
<p begin="00:05:50.594" end="00:05:54.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then yes, yes, a thousand times yes.</p>
<p begin="00:05:57.894" end="00:06:00.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Promise me one thing.</p>
<p begin="00:05:59.594" end="00:06:02.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Anything.</p>
<p begin="00:06:00.394" end="00:06:05.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When the world is unkind, always stand</p>
<p begin="00:06:02.994" end="00:06:09.695" style="s2">beside me. Never let go of my hand.</p>
<p begin="00:06:05.795" end="00:06:09.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Always. I will never let go.</p>
<p begin="00:06:10.734" end="00:06:12.754" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:06:17.095" end="00:06:21.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A Tales by Amy Production.</p>
<p begin="00:06:21.869" end="00:06:23.889" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:06:34.095" end="00:06:38.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daniel, I am not giving you a daughter</p>
<p begin="00:06:35.695" end="00:06:41.295" style="s2">today. I am lending you a treasure.</p>
<p begin="00:06:38.795" end="00:06:43.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will take care of her, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:06:41.295" end="00:06:46.095" style="s2">She is the joy of my house.</p>
<p begin="00:06:43.595" end="00:06:47.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cherish her the way we have.</p>
<p begin="00:06:46.095" end="00:06:49.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:06:47.595" end="00:06:51.195" style="s2">With all my heart.</p>
<p begin="00:06:49.195" end="00:06:52.295" style="s2">If your love for her ever fades, do not</p>
<p begin="00:06:51.195" end="00:06:54.495" style="s2">hate her.</p>
<p begin="00:06:52.295" end="00:06:55.929" style="s2">Bring her back to me and I will care for</p>
<p begin="00:06:54.495" end="00:06:56.395" style="s2">her.</p>
<p begin="00:06:55.929" end="00:06:58.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:06:56.395" end="00:07:00.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That day will never come, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:06:58.595" end="00:07:02.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My daughter,</p>
<p begin="00:07:00.395" end="00:07:04.295" style="s2">in every house you enter, remember who</p>
<p begin="00:07:02.295" end="00:07:05.995" style="s2">you are.</p>
<p begin="00:07:04.295" end="00:07:07.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will, daddy. Thank [music] you for</p>
<p begin="00:07:05.995" end="00:07:10.695" style="s2">everything.</p>
<p begin="00:07:07.295" end="00:07:10.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You made it easy, my princess.</p>
<p begin="00:07:10.994" end="00:07:15.095" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="00:07:12.295" end="00:07:17.595" style="s2">Daniel, will you protect her, honor her,</p>
<p begin="00:07:15.095" end="00:07:19.095" style="s2">and stand by her through every season?</p>
<p begin="00:07:17.595" end="00:07:21.475" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will.</p>
<p begin="00:07:19.095" end="00:07:23.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Amy, will you cherish him, trust him,</p>
<p begin="00:07:21.475" end="00:07:25.195" style="s2">[music] and walk beside him?</p>
<p begin="00:07:23.595" end="00:07:28.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will.</p>
<p begin="00:07:25.195" end="00:07:30.045" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Be happy, my child.</p>
<p begin="00:07:28.025" end="00:07:30.045" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:07:32.695" end="00:07:37.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I pronounce you husband and wife.</p>
<p begin="00:07:34.595" end="00:07:37.595" style="s2">You may kiss your bride.</p>
<p begin="00:07:38.505" end="00:07:42.490" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [singing]</p>
<p begin="00:07:40.470" end="00:07:42.490" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:07:47.595" end="00:07:50.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Congratulations.</p>
<p begin="00:07:52.295" end="00:07:56.695" style="s2">I must admit [music] the girl is a</p>
<p begin="00:07:53.895" end="00:07:56.695" style="s2">beautiful bride.</p>
<p begin="00:07:59.465" end="00:08:01.485" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:08:02.740" end="00:08:04.760" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="00:08:08.495" end="00:08:14.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Charles, you have not touched your food.</p>
<p begin="00:08:11.897" end="00:08:16.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am sorry, mommy. I was thinking.</p>
<p begin="00:08:14.597" end="00:08:18.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He is always thinking.</p>
<p begin="00:08:16.297" end="00:08:19.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone is nice to me.</p>
<p begin="00:08:18.097" end="00:08:21.197" style="s2">Too nice.</p>
<p begin="00:08:19.297" end="00:08:23.597" style="s2">I never know if they like me or my name.</p>
<p begin="00:08:21.197" end="00:08:25.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do not look for a perfect woman, my son.</p>
<p begin="00:08:23.597" end="00:08:27.397" style="s2">Look for a good one. When she comes,</p>
<p begin="00:08:25.497" end="00:08:29.497" style="s2">your heart will know.</p>
<p begin="00:08:27.397" end="00:08:32.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I hope it knows soon.</p>
<p begin="00:08:29.497" end="00:08:36.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe she is somewhere very ordinary.</p>
<p begin="00:08:32.897" end="00:08:36.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I hope I find her there.</p>
<p begin="00:09:03.097" end="00:09:07.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is the best you ever.</p>
<p begin="00:09:05.297" end="00:09:10.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You say that every day.</p>
<p begin="00:09:07.297" end="00:09:10.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And I will say it for 50 years.</p>
<p begin="00:09:18.097" end="00:09:22.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, welcome. We are about to eat.</p>
<p begin="00:09:20.897" end="00:09:24.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A little for me.</p>
<p begin="00:09:22.197" end="00:09:25.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Amy, you should eat small. A woman must</p>
<p begin="00:09:24.097" end="00:09:28.597" style="s2">watch herself in marriage.</p>
<p begin="00:09:25.897" end="00:09:30.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I eat well, mommy. I am healthy.</p>
<p begin="00:09:28.597" end="00:09:33.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I only said eat small. Why are you so</p>
<p begin="00:09:30.497" end="00:09:33.197" style="s2">sensitive?</p>
<p begin="00:09:43.297" end="00:09:46.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daniel, take care of yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:09:45.297" end="00:09:50.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Amy, eat less.</p>
<p begin="00:09:46.997" end="00:09:50.397" style="s2">You know you are married now.</p>
<p begin="00:09:51.197" end="00:09:54.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daniel, did you hear what she said?</p>
<p begin="00:09:53.197" end="00:09:56.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let it go, Amy.</p>
<p begin="00:09:54.697" end="00:09:58.597" style="s2">I do not want to fight with my mother.</p>
<p begin="00:09:56.897" end="00:10:01.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am not asking you to fight. I am</p>
<p begin="00:09:58.597" end="00:10:02.597" style="s2">asking you to notice.</p>
<p begin="00:10:01.397" end="00:10:05.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I noticed. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:10:02.597" end="00:10:05.797" style="s2">Come, let&#39;s finish our food.</p>
<p begin="00:10:07.897" end="00:10:09.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How is married life?</p>
<p begin="00:10:09.156" end="00:10:11.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:10:09.597" end="00:10:12.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine, mommy. Daniel</p>
<p begin="00:10:11.098" end="00:10:14.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; is a good man.</p>
<p begin="00:10:12.398" end="00:10:16.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And his mother?</p>
<p begin="00:10:14.398" end="00:10:18.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She is his mother.</p>
<p begin="00:10:16.398" end="00:10:20.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Amy, I know your real voice from your</p>
<p begin="00:10:18.698" end="00:10:22.598" style="s2">pretending one.</p>
<p begin="00:10:20.598" end="00:10:23.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; makes small jokes about my size. I</p>
<p begin="00:10:22.598" end="00:10:26.298" style="s2">ignore them.</p>
<p begin="00:10:23.898" end="00:10:28.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; is not always peace, my child. Sometimes</p>
<p begin="00:10:26.298" end="00:10:30.198" style="s2">it is a quiet war inside you.</p>
<p begin="00:10:28.298" end="00:10:31.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But I am married now. I cannot run home</p>
<p begin="00:10:30.198" end="00:10:33.098" style="s2">at the first problem.</p>
<p begin="00:10:31.698" end="00:10:34.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am not telling you to run. A husband</p>
<p begin="00:10:33.098" end="00:10:35.898" style="s2">cannot defend a wound he does not know</p>
<p begin="00:10:34.598" end="00:10:37.998" style="s2">about.</p>
<p begin="00:10:35.898" end="00:10:40.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will talk to him.</p>
<p begin="00:10:37.998" end="00:10:42.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And remember, this door is never locked</p>
<p begin="00:10:40.298" end="00:10:42.698" style="s2">to you.</p>
<p begin="00:10:55.698" end="00:10:59.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Amy, I brought you something.</p>
<p begin="00:11:03.198" end="00:11:07.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mummy, what is this?</p>
<p begin="00:11:04.998" end="00:11:09.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Drink it every morning. My church</p>
<p begin="00:11:07.198" end="00:11:10.298" style="s2">friends keep asking why my son&#39;s wife is</p>
<p begin="00:11:09.098" end="00:11:13.398" style="s2">so large.</p>
<p begin="00:11:10.298" end="00:11:15.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mummy, I am healthy. I have told you.</p>
<p begin="00:11:13.398" end="00:11:16.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Healthy? They laugh behind my back. I</p>
<p begin="00:11:15.998" end="00:11:18.587" style="s2">cannot even bring you to the</p>
<p begin="00:11:16.998" end="00:11:19.998" style="s2">Thanksgiving service.</p>
<p begin="00:11:18.587" end="00:11:22.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:11:19.998" end="00:11:24.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mummy, I say this with respect. I am not</p>
<p begin="00:11:22.598" end="00:11:25.998" style="s2">ashamed to you. Please stop speaking</p>
<p begin="00:11:24.698" end="00:11:27.898" style="s2">about my body.</p>
<p begin="00:11:25.998" end="00:11:30.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are correcting me.</p>
<p begin="00:11:27.898" end="00:11:31.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am asking you to treat me kindly in my</p>
<p begin="00:11:30.098" end="00:11:33.998" style="s2">own home.</p>
<p begin="00:11:31.298" end="00:11:35.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your home? It is my son&#39;s home.</p>
<p begin="00:11:33.998" end="00:11:37.898" style="s2">It is ours.</p>
<p begin="00:11:35.498" end="00:11:40.098" style="s2">Daniel and I built it together.</p>
<p begin="00:11:37.898" end="00:11:42.098" style="s2">A girl who answers her elders is no wife</p>
<p begin="00:11:40.098" end="00:11:43.898" style="s2">for my son. And a mother who cannot</p>
<p begin="00:11:42.098" end="00:11:46.698" style="s2">welcome her son&#39;s wife is not protecting</p>
<p begin="00:11:43.898" end="00:11:48.698" style="s2">him, mummy. She&#39;s only holding him back.</p>
<p begin="00:11:46.698" end="00:11:50.898" style="s2">I have been patient long enough. Keep</p>
<p begin="00:11:48.698" end="00:11:51.998" style="s2">eating. I will bring my son something</p>
<p begin="00:11:50.898" end="00:11:53.298" style="s2">better.</p>
<p begin="00:11:51.998" end="00:11:56.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you mean?</p>
<p begin="00:11:53.298" end="00:11:56.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You will see soon enough.</p>
<p begin="00:12:02.498" end="00:12:06.398" style="s2">I only ask to be treated kindly.</p>
<p begin="00:12:14.263" end="00:12:16.283" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:12:20.499" end="00:12:23.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have walked [music] in circles for</p>
<p begin="00:12:21.999" end="00:12:25.599" style="s2">10 minutes.</p>
<p begin="00:12:23.399" end="00:12:28.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am tired of rooms where people clap</p>
<p begin="00:12:25.599" end="00:12:30.499" style="s2">and nobody knows me.</p>
<p begin="00:12:28.299" end="00:12:33.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then go somewhere ordinary.</p>
<p begin="00:12:30.499" end="00:12:33.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe I will.</p>
<p begin="00:12:38.199" end="00:12:41.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daniel, [music]</p>
<p begin="00:12:39.199" end="00:12:43.199" style="s2">I need to talk to you about your mother.</p>
<p begin="00:12:41.699" end="00:12:44.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Amy, not again.</p>
<p begin="00:12:43.199" end="00:12:45.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is the first time I am saying it</p>
<p begin="00:12:44.699" end="00:12:47.899" style="s2">clearly.</p>
<p begin="00:12:45.799" end="00:12:49.299" style="s2">She keeps commenting on my body. It</p>
<p begin="00:12:47.899" end="00:12:51.399" style="s2">hurts.</p>
<p begin="00:12:49.299" end="00:12:53.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She is only looking out for you. That is</p>
<p begin="00:12:51.399" end="00:12:55.099" style="s2">how her generation talks.</p>
<p begin="00:12:53.799" end="00:12:56.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A knife cuts, [music]</p>
<p begin="00:12:55.099" end="00:12:58.199" style="s2">whether the hand holding it meant to or</p>
<p begin="00:12:56.799" end="00:12:59.899" style="s2">not.</p>
<p begin="00:12:58.199" end="00:13:01.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please do not be dramatic. You are</p>
<p begin="00:12:59.899" end="00:13:02.999" style="s2">strong.</p>
<p begin="00:13:01.099" end="00:13:04.499" style="s2">Just let it pass.</p>
<p begin="00:13:02.999" end="00:13:05.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And if it gets worse?</p>
<p begin="00:13:04.499" end="00:13:08.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It will not.</p>
<p begin="00:13:05.699" end="00:13:08.599" style="s2">Come, let us sleep.</p>
<p begin="00:13:13.214" end="00:13:15.234" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [singing]</p>
<p begin="00:13:19.764" end="00:13:21.784" style="s2">[crying]</p>
<p begin="00:13:24.899" end="00:13:29.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, welcome. We were about to eat.</p>
<p begin="00:13:26.599" end="00:13:29.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I did not come for food.</p>
<p begin="00:13:32.499" end="00:13:38.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daniel, this is Vivian. Vivian, my son.</p>
<p begin="00:13:35.899" end="00:13:41.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, what is this?</p>
<p begin="00:13:38.999" end="00:13:42.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is the wife I chose for you. Sit,</p>
<p begin="00:13:41.299" end="00:13:46.399" style="s2">my dear.</p>
<p begin="00:13:42.999" end="00:13:49.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, I am Daniel&#39;s wife.</p>
<p begin="00:13:46.399" end="00:13:51.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told my son times without number to</p>
<p begin="00:13:49.099" end="00:13:53.699" style="s2">leave this fat woman.</p>
<p begin="00:13:51.299" end="00:13:56.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, please.</p>
<p begin="00:13:53.699" end="00:13:57.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But he refused. He insisted on marrying</p>
<p begin="00:13:56.299" end="00:13:59.999" style="s2">you. Now look at the shame you have</p>
<p begin="00:13:57.999" end="00:14:02.499" style="s2">caused me.</p>
<p begin="00:13:59.999" end="00:14:02.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daniel,</p>
<p begin="00:14:02.999" end="00:14:07.199" style="s2">look at Vivian. This is how a woman</p>
<p begin="00:14:05.099" end="00:14:09.399" style="s2">should look, not like you, who cannot</p>
<p begin="00:14:07.199" end="00:14:11.899" style="s2">even sit properly on a chair.</p>
<p begin="00:14:09.399" end="00:14:13.899" style="s2">Daniel, say something.</p>
<p begin="00:14:11.899" end="00:14:15.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; On the beach you promised me. You said</p>
<p begin="00:14:13.899" end="00:14:15.901" style="s2">always.</p>
<p begin="00:14:15.299" end="00:14:17.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, for</p>
<p begin="00:14:15.901" end="00:14:20.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; eight months I stayed quiet. I thought</p>
<p begin="00:14:17.901" end="00:14:21.701" style="s2">respect meant silence.</p>
<p begin="00:14:20.401" end="00:14:23.401" style="s2">But you bring another woman into my</p>
<p begin="00:14:21.701" end="00:14:24.601" style="s2">house in front of me to show me I am not</p>
<p begin="00:14:23.401" end="00:14:25.601" style="s2">enough?</p>
<p begin="00:14:24.601" end="00:14:27.601" style="s2">No.</p>
<p begin="00:14:25.601" end="00:14:31.201" style="s2">Do not talk to me like that in my son&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:14:27.601" end="00:14:33.401" style="s2">house. Then let your son speak in it.</p>
<p begin="00:14:31.201" end="00:14:35.201" style="s2">Silence is a choice. When someone you</p>
<p begin="00:14:33.401" end="00:14:37.701" style="s2">love is hurt and you say nothing, that</p>
<p begin="00:14:35.201" end="00:14:40.101" style="s2">is not peace. That is agreement.</p>
<p begin="00:14:37.701" end="00:14:42.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Amy, please. Let us talk tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:14:40.101" end="00:14:45.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We have talked many times. I am done.</p>
<p begin="00:14:42.801" end="00:14:48.201" style="s2">I am a fat woman. I have never hidden</p>
<p begin="00:14:45.301" end="00:14:50.601" style="s2">it. I did not become small for love, and</p>
<p begin="00:14:48.201" end="00:14:53.701" style="s2">I will not become small for anyone.</p>
<p begin="00:14:50.601" end="00:14:56.401" style="s2">I want a divorce, Daniel.</p>
<p begin="00:14:53.701" end="00:14:56.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Amy, wait.</p>
<p begin="00:15:05.220" end="00:15:07.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:15:17.665" end="00:15:19.685" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:15:21.595" end="00:15:23.615" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="00:15:27.901" end="00:15:31.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come in, my child. You are home.</p>
<p begin="00:15:39.301" end="00:15:42.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, mommy, I failed.</p>
<p begin="00:15:41.601" end="00:15:43.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:15:42.601" end="00:15:45.201" style="s2">Listen to me.</p>
<p begin="00:15:43.701" end="00:15:46.701" style="s2">The one who fails is the one who breaks</p>
<p begin="00:15:45.201" end="00:15:47.801" style="s2">the promise, not the one who leaves the</p>
<p begin="00:15:46.701" end="00:15:50.101" style="s2">broken house.</p>
<p begin="00:15:47.801" end="00:15:52.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; People will say I could not endure.</p>
<p begin="00:15:50.101" end="00:15:54.601" style="s2">Enduring is not the same as staying.</p>
<p begin="00:15:52.701" end="00:15:57.001" style="s2">A woman can endure and still be dying</p>
<p begin="00:15:54.601" end="00:15:59.501" style="s2">inside.</p>
<p begin="00:15:57.001" end="00:16:01.101" style="s2">I started to believe her, mommy.</p>
<p begin="00:15:59.501" end="00:16:02.401" style="s2">I looked in the mirror and felt too big</p>
<p begin="00:16:01.101" end="00:16:04.201" style="s2">for this world.</p>
<p begin="00:16:02.401" end="00:16:06.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your body did not change. Your worth did</p>
<p begin="00:16:04.201" end="00:16:08.301" style="s2">not change. Only the mirror around you</p>
<p begin="00:16:06.201" end="00:16:09.901" style="s2">changed. A cracked mirror shows a</p>
<p begin="00:16:08.301" end="00:16:11.701" style="s2">cracked face. It does not mean you are</p>
<p begin="00:16:09.901" end="00:16:13.801" style="s2">cracked.</p>
<p begin="00:16:11.701" end="00:16:16.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cry tonight. [music] Tomorrow we rise</p>
<p begin="00:16:13.801" end="00:16:16.301" style="s2">together.</p>
<p begin="00:16:20.101" end="00:16:23.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A</p>
<p begin="00:16:20.802" end="00:16:27.802" style="s2">by Amy Production.</p>
<p begin="00:16:23.702" end="00:16:30.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The place where you are.</p>
<p begin="00:16:27.802" end="00:16:34.702" style="s2">So stay right here.</p>
<p begin="00:16:30.702" end="00:16:36.502" style="s2">Don&#39;t go [singing] too far.</p>
<p begin="00:16:34.702" end="00:16:37.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are reading again. That is a good</p>
<p begin="00:16:36.502" end="00:16:40.002" style="s2">sign.</p>
<p begin="00:16:37.702" end="00:16:42.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, how can a man say he loves you</p>
<p begin="00:16:40.002" end="00:16:44.402" style="s2">and watch you being broken?</p>
<p begin="00:16:42.702" end="00:16:45.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Some people love you only when it is</p>
<p begin="00:16:44.402" end="00:16:49.602" style="s2">easy.</p>
<p begin="00:16:45.902" end="00:16:52.302" style="s2">Real love shows when it costs something.</p>
<p begin="00:16:49.602" end="00:16:54.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do not want to become bitter.</p>
<p begin="00:16:52.302" end="00:16:56.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then do not.</p>
<p begin="00:16:54.202" end="00:16:58.202" style="s2">Bitterness is poison you drink hoping</p>
<p begin="00:16:56.002" end="00:17:00.302" style="s2">the other person will fall sick.</p>
<p begin="00:16:58.202" end="00:17:02.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So I should forgive him?</p>
<p begin="00:17:00.302" end="00:17:04.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Forgive, not because he deserves it, but</p>
<p begin="00:17:02.402" end="00:17:05.602" style="s2">because you deserve peace.</p>
<p begin="00:17:04.202" end="00:17:07.502" style="s2">Forgiving is not going back. It is</p>
<p begin="00:17:05.602" end="00:17:09.902" style="s2">closing the door gently.</p>
<p begin="00:17:07.502" end="00:17:13.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, you should be a preacher.</p>
<p begin="00:17:09.902" end="00:17:13.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am a father. It is a bigger job.</p>
<p begin="00:17:17.531" end="00:17:19.551" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:17:27.202" end="00:17:33.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was looking for a place where my heart</p>
<p begin="00:17:31.702" end="00:17:37.602" style="s2">could [singing] finally rest, [music]</p>
<p begin="00:17:33.702" end="00:17:39.602" style="s2">somewhere I could close my eyes</p>
<p begin="00:17:37.602" end="00:17:41.602" style="s2">and forget about</p>
<p begin="00:17:39.602" end="00:17:44.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not too much, [music] not too little,</p>
<p begin="00:17:41.602" end="00:17:45.802" style="s2">just right.</p>
<p begin="00:17:44.302" end="00:17:47.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; like a light I [music and singing]</p>
<p begin="00:17:45.802" end="00:17:51.302" style="s2">didn&#39;t know.</p>
<p begin="00:17:47.902" end="00:17:53.802" style="s2">And somehow in your arms</p>
<p begin="00:17:51.302" end="00:17:55.202" style="s2">I found the place called home.</p>
<p begin="00:17:53.802" end="00:17:56.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good afternoon. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:17:55.202" end="00:17:59.002" style="s2">Are you the designer?</p>
<p begin="00:17:56.402" end="00:18:00.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am. How can I help you?</p>
<p begin="00:17:59.002" end="00:18:03.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My mother&#39;s birthday is soon.</p>
<p begin="00:18:00.902" end="00:18:05.302" style="s2">I want to give her a dress,</p>
<p begin="00:18:03.002" end="00:18:06.702" style="s2">but I do not know what she would like.</p>
<p begin="00:18:05.302" end="00:18:07.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is she like?</p>
<p begin="00:18:06.702" end="00:18:09.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kind,</p>
<p begin="00:18:07.802" end="00:18:10.702" style="s2">quiet.</p>
<p begin="00:18:09.102" end="00:18:12.302" style="s2">She hides her own wishes to make room</p>
<p begin="00:18:10.702" end="00:18:13.702" style="s2">for others.</p>
<p begin="00:18:12.302" end="00:18:15.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then she needs a dress that says her</p>
<p begin="00:18:13.702" end="00:18:16.602" style="s2">wishes matter.</p>
<p begin="00:18:15.202" end="00:18:18.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That is exactly it.</p>
<p begin="00:18:16.602" end="00:18:20.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Give me two weeks.</p>
<p begin="00:18:18.202" end="00:18:22.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; May I check on the progress sometimes.</p>
<p begin="00:18:20.303" end="00:18:22.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You may.</p>
<p begin="00:18:32.857" end="00:18:36.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music and singing]</p>
<p begin="00:18:34.303" end="00:18:39.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are somewhere else today.</p>
<p begin="00:18:36.503" end="00:18:40.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Charles, I was married.</p>
<p begin="00:18:39.003" end="00:18:42.203" style="s2">I am divorced now.</p>
<p begin="00:18:40.903" end="00:18:43.703" style="s2">I did not tell you because I was</p>
<p begin="00:18:42.203" end="00:18:46.203" style="s2">ashamed.</p>
<p begin="00:18:43.703" end="00:18:47.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why ashamed?</p>
<p begin="00:18:46.203" end="00:18:49.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The man I married said he loved me as I</p>
<p begin="00:18:47.903" end="00:18:50.503" style="s2">am.</p>
<p begin="00:18:49.003" end="00:18:51.903" style="s2">Then he stayed silent while his mother</p>
<p begin="00:18:50.503" end="00:18:53.103" style="s2">shamed my body.</p>
<p begin="00:18:51.903" end="00:18:54.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am sorry, Amy.</p>
<p begin="00:18:53.103" end="00:18:55.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sometimes I still wonder if I am the</p>
<p begin="00:18:54.503" end="00:18:57.003" style="s2">problem.</p>
<p begin="00:18:55.203" end="00:18:59.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are not. People who shame others are</p>
<p begin="00:18:57.003" end="00:19:01.503" style="s2">afraid of something inside themselves.</p>
<p begin="00:18:59.103" end="00:19:03.203" style="s2">Cruelty is only a mask that fear wears.</p>
<p begin="00:19:01.503" end="00:19:04.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; People say kind words</p>
<p begin="00:19:03.203" end="00:19:06.303" style="s2">and then things change.</p>
<p begin="00:19:04.703" end="00:19:08.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I will not say words.</p>
<p begin="00:19:06.303" end="00:19:09.903" style="s2">I will only tell you what I notice.</p>
<p begin="00:19:08.403" end="00:19:11.703" style="s2">You hum when you work. You treat</p>
<p begin="00:19:09.903" end="00:19:15.603" style="s2">everyone with respect. You laugh with</p>
<p begin="00:19:11.703" end="00:19:15.603" style="s2">your whole self. That is who you are.</p>
<p begin="00:19:16.603" end="00:19:19.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:19:17.903" end="00:19:20.803" style="s2">Nobody has said it without wanting</p>
<p begin="00:19:19.503" end="00:19:22.803" style="s2">something.</p>
<p begin="00:19:20.803" end="00:19:24.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do want one thing.</p>
<p begin="00:19:22.803" end="00:19:27.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:19:24.303" end="00:19:29.243" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To keep coming to this studio.</p>
<p begin="00:19:27.223" end="00:19:29.243" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:19:38.358" end="00:19:40.378" style="s2">[music and singing]</p>
<p begin="00:19:41.203" end="00:19:44.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This, Charles, you speak about him a</p>
<p begin="00:19:43.203" end="00:19:46.603" style="s2">lot.</p>
<p begin="00:19:44.503" end="00:19:48.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He is different, mommy.</p>
<p begin="00:19:46.603" end="00:19:51.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But I am afraid.</p>
<p begin="00:19:48.003" end="00:19:53.403" style="s2">What if I make the same mistake?</p>
<p begin="00:19:51.203" end="00:19:55.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fear is not always a warning.</p>
<p begin="00:19:53.403" end="00:19:56.703" style="s2">Sometimes it is a scar remembering the</p>
<p begin="00:19:55.103" end="00:19:58.203" style="s2">knife.</p>
<p begin="00:19:56.703" end="00:19:59.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So what do I do?</p>
<p begin="00:19:58.203" end="00:20:01.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go slowly.</p>
<p begin="00:19:59.403" end="00:20:02.003" style="s2">Let him show you who he is in small</p>
<p begin="00:20:01.003" end="00:20:03.903" style="s2">things.</p>
<p begin="00:20:02.003" end="00:20:06.603" style="s2">Character shows in the small moments</p>
<p begin="00:20:03.903" end="00:20:08.703" style="s2">when nobody is clapping.</p>
<p begin="00:20:06.603" end="00:20:10.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; May I bring him home?</p>
<p begin="00:20:08.703" end="00:20:11.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bring him.</p>
<p begin="00:20:10.103" end="00:20:13.903" style="s2">An honest man does not fear an old</p>
<p begin="00:20:11.603" end="00:20:13.903" style="s2">father.</p>
<p begin="00:20:14.383" end="00:20:16.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [singing]</p>
<p begin="00:20:20.934" end="00:20:23.805" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:20:21.005" end="00:20:27.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Love is choosing [singing] someone when</p>
<p begin="00:20:23.805" end="00:20:29.805" style="s2">the road gets hard.</p>
<p begin="00:20:27.505" end="00:20:30.805" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Charles, you said your family had a nice</p>
<p begin="00:20:29.805" end="00:20:33.305" style="s2">home.</p>
<p begin="00:20:30.805" end="00:20:34.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I said nice. I did not lie.</p>
<p begin="00:20:33.305" end="00:20:37.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You did not say you were Charles</p>
<p begin="00:20:34.605" end="00:20:38.905" style="s2">Anderson of Anderson Holdings.</p>
<p begin="00:20:37.105" end="00:20:41.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wanted one person to know me before my</p>
<p begin="00:20:38.905" end="00:20:43.105" style="s2">bank account. Are you angry?</p>
<p begin="00:20:41.905" end="00:20:45.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A little.</p>
<p begin="00:20:43.105" end="00:20:47.005" style="s2">I told you my deepest shame, Charles.</p>
<p begin="00:20:45.305" end="00:20:48.505" style="s2">You kept your biggest secret.</p>
<p begin="00:20:47.005" end="00:20:50.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:20:48.505" end="00:20:52.605" style="s2">Every woman before you loved my name</p>
<p begin="00:20:50.105" end="00:20:54.405" style="s2">first. I was afraid you would too.</p>
<p begin="00:20:52.605" end="00:20:55.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then you should have trusted me.</p>
<p begin="00:20:54.405" end="00:20:57.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are right.</p>
<p begin="00:20:55.705" end="00:21:00.205" style="s2">I am sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:20:57.605" end="00:21:01.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do not hide from me again.</p>
<p begin="00:21:00.205" end="00:21:03.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Never.</p>
<p begin="00:21:01.605" end="00:21:06.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I forgive you.</p>
<p begin="00:21:03.405" end="00:21:06.305" style="s2">Come, let us go in.</p>
<p begin="00:21:21.194" end="00:21:23.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [singing]</p>
<p begin="00:21:26.205" end="00:21:29.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Charles, we love her.</p>
<p begin="00:21:27.705" end="00:21:30.705" style="s2">But I must ask what mommy is thinking.</p>
<p begin="00:21:29.605" end="00:21:31.905" style="s2">Are you ready for the talk about her</p>
<p begin="00:21:30.705" end="00:21:33.605" style="s2">body?</p>
<p begin="00:21:31.905" end="00:21:35.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Victoria, all my life people have judged</p>
<p begin="00:21:33.605" end="00:21:36.905" style="s2">me by my money.</p>
<p begin="00:21:35.505" end="00:21:39.605" style="s2">I know what it feels like to be seen as</p>
<p begin="00:21:36.905" end="00:21:41.205" style="s2">something other than yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:21:39.605" end="00:21:43.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And?</p>
<p begin="00:21:41.205" end="00:21:45.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will never choose a person by what the</p>
<p begin="00:21:43.005" end="00:21:46.905" style="s2">world will say.</p>
<p begin="00:21:45.405" end="00:21:48.705" style="s2">I will choose the one who makes me a</p>
<p begin="00:21:46.905" end="00:21:50.705" style="s2">better man.</p>
<p begin="00:21:48.705" end="00:21:54.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That is my son.</p>
<p begin="00:21:50.705" end="00:21:57.905" style="s2">I only wanted to be sure you were sure.</p>
<p begin="00:21:54.405" end="00:21:57.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have never been more sure.</p>
<p begin="00:21:59.185" end="00:22:01.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:22:06.605" end="00:22:10.805" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A Tales by Amy Production.</p>
<p begin="00:22:11.630" end="00:22:15.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:22:12.805" end="00:22:16.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are early.</p>
<p begin="00:22:15.205" end="00:22:18.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I did not want to keep your father</p>
<p begin="00:22:16.705" end="00:22:21.205" style="s2">waiting.</p>
<p begin="00:22:18.505" end="00:22:24.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That means you are nervous.</p>
<p begin="00:22:21.205" end="00:22:24.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I am nervous.</p>
<p begin="00:22:26.695" end="00:22:28.715" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [singing]</p>
<p begin="00:22:32.006" end="00:22:34.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good evening, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:22:33.406" end="00:22:36.906" style="s2">Good evening, ma.</p>
<p begin="00:22:34.406" end="00:22:38.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Welcome, Charles. Amy has told us a lot</p>
<p begin="00:22:36.906" end="00:22:39.806" style="s2">about you.</p>
<p begin="00:22:38.306" end="00:22:42.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These are for you, ma.</p>
<p begin="00:22:39.806" end="00:22:44.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; White flowers.</p>
<p begin="00:22:42.006" end="00:22:46.806" style="s2">She said you were thoughtful.</p>
<p begin="00:22:44.106" end="00:22:46.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sit, young man.</p>
<p begin="00:22:47.806" end="00:22:50.806" style="s2">My daughter tells me your family is</p>
<p begin="00:22:49.606" end="00:22:52.106" style="s2">wealthy.</p>
<p begin="00:22:50.806" end="00:22:53.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:22:52.106" end="00:22:55.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will not ask about your money.</p>
<p begin="00:22:53.906" end="00:22:57.806" style="s2">I will ask about your heart.</p>
<p begin="00:22:55.806" end="00:22:59.406" style="s2">What do you want with my daughter?</p>
<p begin="00:22:57.806" end="00:23:00.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To walk beside her, sir. Nothing more,</p>
<p begin="00:22:59.406" end="00:23:03.106" style="s2">nothing less.</p>
<p begin="00:23:00.806" end="00:23:05.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The last man promised the same.</p>
<p begin="00:23:03.106" end="00:23:07.506" style="s2">Words came easily to him.</p>
<p begin="00:23:05.306" end="00:23:09.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then do not trust my words, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:23:07.506" end="00:23:11.206" style="s2">Watch what I do.</p>
<p begin="00:23:09.606" end="00:23:12.906" style="s2">That is wiser than most young men</p>
<p begin="00:23:11.206" end="00:23:15.906" style="s2">manage.</p>
<p begin="00:23:12.906" end="00:23:17.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come, the food is ready.</p>
<p begin="00:23:15.906" end="00:23:20.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Amy says the rice in this house never</p>
<p begin="00:23:17.406" end="00:23:21.406" style="s2">burns because it knows she is happy.</p>
<p begin="00:23:20.106" end="00:23:24.506" style="s2">It is true.</p>
<p begin="00:23:21.406" end="00:23:24.506" style="s2">Mind that you keep her happy.</p>
<p begin="00:23:27.106" end="00:23:30.941" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, may I take Amy out to dinner on</p>
<p begin="00:23:28.806" end="00:23:30.941" style="s2">Saturday? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:23:31.406" end="00:23:34.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you wish to go?</p>
<p begin="00:23:33.106" end="00:23:35.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do.</p>
<p begin="00:23:34.306" end="00:23:36.781" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then go.</p>
<p begin="00:23:35.506" end="00:23:38.801" style="s2">Be home at a decent hour.</p>
<p begin="00:23:36.781" end="00:23:38.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:23:45.951" end="00:23:49.406" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:23:47.606" end="00:23:50.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You look</p>
<p begin="00:23:49.406" end="00:23:50.906" style="s2">I do not have the words.</p>
<p begin="00:23:50.536" end="00:23:53.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:23:50.906" end="00:23:56.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You usually do.</p>
<p begin="00:23:53.006" end="00:23:56.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tonight they have left me.</p>
<p begin="00:23:57.741" end="00:24:01.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [singing]</p>
<p begin="00:23:59.506" end="00:24:03.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It is beautiful, Charles.</p>
<p begin="00:24:01.506" end="00:24:05.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wanted a place where only you [music]</p>
<p begin="00:24:03.206" end="00:24:06.706" style="s2">and the stars could hear me.</p>
<p begin="00:24:05.106" end="00:24:08.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why so quiet?</p>
<p begin="00:24:06.706" end="00:24:10.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do not need a crowd to know [music]</p>
<p begin="00:24:08.306" end="00:24:10.906" style="s2">you matter.</p>
<p begin="00:24:11.506" end="00:24:14.606" style="s2">Do you remember the day I walked into</p>
<p begin="00:24:12.806" end="00:24:17.006" style="s2">your studio?</p>
<p begin="00:24:14.606" end="00:24:18.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You wanted a dress for your mother.</p>
<p begin="00:24:17.006" end="00:24:20.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I left [music] with a reason to come</p>
<p begin="00:24:18.406" end="00:24:23.306" style="s2">back every week.</p>
<p begin="00:24:20.406" end="00:24:25.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were not subtle.</p>
<p begin="00:24:23.306" end="00:24:26.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am not subtle now.</p>
<p begin="00:24:25.006" end="00:24:29.408" style="s2">Amy Williams,</p>
<p begin="00:24:26.706" end="00:24:31.607" style="s2">you You me that confidence is not loud.</p>
<p begin="00:24:29.408" end="00:24:33.707" style="s2">Will you marry me?</p>
<p begin="00:24:31.607" end="00:24:37.041" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Charles, the last time a man knelt in</p>
<p begin="00:24:33.707" end="00:24:37.107" style="s2">front of me, I believed every word.</p>
<p begin="00:24:37.041" end="00:24:39.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:24:37.107" end="00:24:42.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then do not believe my words.</p>
<p begin="00:24:39.107" end="00:24:46.707" style="s2">Watch me for the rest of our lives.</p>
<p begin="00:24:42.307" end="00:24:46.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I will watch, and my answer is yes.</p>
<p begin="00:24:48.207" end="00:24:51.507" style="s2">Daddy said fear [music] is a scar</p>
<p begin="00:24:49.707" end="00:24:53.417" style="s2">remembering the knife.</p>
<p begin="00:24:51.507" end="00:24:55.437" style="s2">Tonight I feel none.</p>
<p begin="00:24:53.417" end="00:24:55.437" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="00:25:03.007" end="00:25:08.107" style="s2">Daddy, I want to begin taking care of my</p>
<p begin="00:25:04.707" end="00:25:09.908" style="s2">health, walking more, eating better.</p>
<p begin="00:25:08.107" end="00:25:11.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is this because of Charles? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:25:09.908" end="00:25:13.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:25:11.007" end="00:25:15.707" style="s2">He has never asked me to change. This is</p>
<p begin="00:25:13.307" end="00:25:15.707" style="s2">for me.</p>
<p begin="00:25:16.307" end="00:25:20.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I support you completely.</p>
<p begin="00:25:18.507" end="00:25:22.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With Daniel, I felt I had to change to</p>
<p begin="00:25:20.207" end="00:25:23.307" style="s2">be [music] accepted. This time it is my</p>
<p begin="00:25:22.007" end="00:25:24.807" style="s2">choice.</p>
<p begin="00:25:23.307" end="00:25:26.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Change that comes from love for yourself</p>
<p begin="00:25:24.807" end="00:25:28.607" style="s2">is growth. Change that comes from shame</p>
<p begin="00:25:26.908" end="00:25:31.707" style="s2">is punishment. [music] Remember that,</p>
<p begin="00:25:28.607" end="00:25:31.707" style="s2">and you will always be free.</p>
<p begin="00:25:45.307" end="00:25:48.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Charles,</p>
<p begin="00:25:46.507" end="00:25:50.307" style="s2">I once gave my daughter&#39;s hand to a man</p>
<p begin="00:25:48.207" end="00:25:51.908" style="s2">who promised to love her as she is. I</p>
<p begin="00:25:50.307" end="00:25:53.607" style="s2">will not only promise her, [music] I</p>
<p begin="00:25:51.908" end="00:25:55.107" style="s2">will show you every day.</p>
<p begin="00:25:53.607" end="00:25:57.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do not need your promise. I have</p>
<p begin="00:25:55.107" end="00:25:59.507" style="s2">watched your actions for one year. That</p>
<p begin="00:25:57.007" end="00:25:59.507" style="s2">is enough.</p>
<p begin="00:26:00.107" end="00:26:04.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, Daddy.</p>
<p begin="00:26:02.107" end="00:26:07.487" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The wind blew my daughter,</p>
<p begin="00:26:04.507" end="00:26:07.487" style="s2">and you are still standing. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:26:28.207" end="00:26:32.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A Tales by Amy Production.</p>
<p begin="00:26:47.388" end="00:26:49.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:26:53.409" end="00:26:57.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daniel,</p>
<p begin="00:26:54.509" end="00:26:59.809" style="s2">is that Amy?</p>
<p begin="00:26:57.109" end="00:27:03.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It cannot be.</p>
<p begin="00:26:59.809" end="00:27:05.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She looks like a queen.</p>
<p begin="00:27:03.009" end="00:27:05.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How? How is this possible? Who whose car</p>
<p begin="00:27:05.209" end="00:27:07.509" style="s2">is that?</p>
<p begin="00:27:05.809" end="00:27:08.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Amy, who are they?</p>
<p begin="00:27:07.509" end="00:27:09.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daniel</p>
<p begin="00:27:08.509" end="00:27:11.209" style="s2">and his mother.</p>
<p begin="00:27:09.909" end="00:27:14.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you want to go inside?</p>
<p begin="00:27:11.209" end="00:27:14.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. Stay beside me.</p>
<p begin="00:27:17.209" end="00:27:22.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Amy, you look how are you?</p>
<p begin="00:27:19.709" end="00:27:23.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am well, Daniel, very well.</p>
<p begin="00:27:22.009" end="00:27:26.009" style="s2">And who is this gentleman?</p>
<p begin="00:27:23.709" end="00:27:27.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Charles Anderson, Amy&#39;s husband.</p>
<p begin="00:27:26.009" end="00:27:28.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Anderson? Anderson Holdings?</p>
<p begin="00:27:27.909" end="00:27:31.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:27:28.709" end="00:27:32.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Husband? Yes, ma, husband.</p>
<p begin="00:27:31.709" end="00:27:34.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You see?</p>
<p begin="00:27:32.809" end="00:27:36.809" style="s2">You see what you did?</p>
<p begin="00:27:34.009" end="00:27:36.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daniel, please.</p>
<p begin="00:27:37.109" end="00:27:40.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because of you, I lost her.</p>
<p begin="00:27:39.409" end="00:27:41.909" style="s2">Because of you, I am no longer married</p>
<p begin="00:27:40.809" end="00:27:43.709" style="s2">to Amy.</p>
<p begin="00:27:41.909" end="00:27:45.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I only said what I thought.</p>
<p begin="00:27:43.709" end="00:27:47.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You shamed her at my table and I let</p>
<p begin="00:27:45.509" end="00:27:48.509" style="s2">you. You made me act that way. This is</p>
<p begin="00:27:47.509" end="00:27:49.909" style="s2">your fault, mommy.</p>
<p begin="00:27:48.509" end="00:27:51.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daniel, a mother can speak the wrong</p>
<p begin="00:27:49.909" end="00:27:52.809" style="s2">words, but only you chose to stay</p>
<p begin="00:27:51.409" end="00:27:54.409" style="s2">silent.</p>
<p begin="00:27:52.809" end="00:27:55.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have a wife now.</p>
<p begin="00:27:54.409" end="00:27:58.909" style="s2">My mother chose her.</p>
<p begin="00:27:55.609" end="00:27:58.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I hope you find peace, Daniel.</p>
<p begin="00:28:00.709" end="00:28:03.509" style="s2">I hope he learns. Let him go and join</p>
<p begin="00:28:02.409" end="00:28:04.209" style="s2">his wife.</p>
<p begin="00:28:03.509" end="00:28:06.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are not angry? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:28:04.209" end="00:28:08.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not anymore. Life does not need my help</p>
<p begin="00:28:06.209" end="00:28:08.709" style="s2">to teach him.</p>
<p begin="00:28:10.574" end="00:28:12.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music and singing]</p>
<p begin="00:28:17.124" end="00:28:19.144" style="s2">[music and singing]</p>
<p begin="00:28:23.509" end="00:28:27.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are late. Where is the money I asked</p>
<p begin="00:28:25.809" end="00:28:29.409" style="s2">for?</p>
<p begin="00:28:27.109" end="00:28:31.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good evening to you too, Vivian.</p>
<p begin="00:28:29.409" end="00:28:34.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do not start.</p>
<p begin="00:28:31.209" end="00:28:35.210" style="s2">I I 300,000 naira for my hair and shoes</p>
<p begin="00:28:34.110" end="00:28:37.610" style="s2">this weekend.</p>
<p begin="00:28:35.210" end="00:28:40.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I gave you money last week.</p>
<p begin="00:28:37.610" end="00:28:40.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That was last week.</p>
<p begin="00:28:42.110" end="00:28:46.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You went out looking like that.</p>
<p begin="00:28:44.010" end="00:28:46.610" style="s2">Look at you.</p>
<p begin="00:28:48.210" end="00:28:52.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Vivian,</p>
<p begin="00:28:49.410" end="00:28:54.110" style="s2">I brought soup for you.</p>
<p begin="00:28:52.310" end="00:28:55.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, this soup is cold.</p>
<p begin="00:28:54.110" end="00:28:58.410" style="s2">Next time cook it properly or do not</p>
<p begin="00:28:55.910" end="00:28:58.410" style="s2">bring it.</p>
<p begin="00:28:58.610" end="00:29:03.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daniel, this is the girl I chose.</p>
<p begin="00:29:12.210" end="00:29:15.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Vivian, we need to talk.</p>
<p begin="00:29:13.710" end="00:29:17.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; About what? The money?</p>
<p begin="00:29:15.610" end="00:29:19.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; About everything.</p>
<p begin="00:29:17.110" end="00:29:23.310" style="s2">You insulted my mother in front of me.</p>
<p begin="00:29:19.510" end="00:29:25.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She cooks badly. I only said the truth.</p>
<p begin="00:29:23.310" end="00:29:26.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You see why I prefer Amy to you.</p>
<p begin="00:29:25.710" end="00:29:29.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:29:26.710" end="00:29:31.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She is humble. She is loving. She never</p>
<p begin="00:29:29.410" end="00:29:33.310" style="s2">once asked me for money.</p>
<p begin="00:29:31.110" end="00:29:34.910" style="s2">All you know is how to ask and ask and</p>
<p begin="00:29:33.310" end="00:29:37.110" style="s2">ask.</p>
<p begin="00:29:34.910" end="00:29:39.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then go back to Amy.</p>
<p begin="00:29:37.110" end="00:29:41.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wish I could.</p>
<p begin="00:29:39.110" end="00:29:43.010" style="s2">I do not even know where my mother found</p>
<p begin="00:29:41.010" end="00:29:44.710" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:29:43.010" end="00:29:47.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your mother found me because she wanted</p>
<p begin="00:29:44.710" end="00:29:50.510" style="s2">a wife who looked good. She got one. Now</p>
<p begin="00:29:47.710" end="00:29:50.510" style="s2">pay for her.</p>
<p begin="00:29:50.910" end="00:29:55.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I threw away gold</p>
<p begin="00:29:53.010" end="00:29:55.810" style="s2">and I picked glitter.</p>
<p begin="00:29:58.010" end="00:30:02.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A Tales by Amy Production.</p>
<p begin="00:30:03.510" end="00:30:09.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have been quiet since the gate.</p>
<p begin="00:30:06.110" end="00:30:10.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was thinking about how I felt.</p>
<p begin="00:30:09.210" end="00:30:14.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And how did you feel?</p>
<p begin="00:30:10.710" end="00:30:16.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing, no anger, no joy at his pain,</p>
<p begin="00:30:14.610" end="00:30:18.110" style="s2">just peace.</p>
<p begin="00:30:16.410" end="00:30:20.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That is rare.</p>
<p begin="00:30:18.110" end="00:30:22.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My father says peace is the reward for</p>
<p begin="00:30:20.510" end="00:30:24.610" style="s2">those who [music] forgive without going</p>
<p begin="00:30:22.110" end="00:30:24.610" style="s2">back.</p>
<p begin="00:30:31.510" end="00:30:34.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A bigger studio</p>
<p begin="00:30:33.010" end="00:30:36.510" style="s2">for your fashion house.</p>
<p begin="00:30:34.310" end="00:30:37.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Charles, it is too [music] much.</p>
<p begin="00:30:36.510" end="00:30:38.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You told me</p>
<p begin="00:30:37.012" end="00:30:40.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; you always wanted to sew beautiful</p>
<p begin="00:30:38.512" end="00:30:41.812" style="s2">clothes for women of every size.</p>
<p begin="00:30:40.612" end="00:30:44.312" style="s2">This is the place.</p>
<p begin="00:30:41.812" end="00:30:46.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will call it just right, because that</p>
<p begin="00:30:44.312" end="00:30:49.212" style="s2">is how every woman should feel.</p>
<p begin="00:30:46.812" end="00:30:51.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your pain became your purpose.</p>
<p begin="00:30:49.212" end="00:30:54.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you stood beside me when I did not</p>
<p begin="00:30:51.312" end="00:30:54.812" style="s2">even know I was standing.</p>
<p begin="00:31:08.412" end="00:31:12.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Amy, do you remember what I told you the</p>
<p begin="00:31:10.412" end="00:31:15.412" style="s2">morning of the market?</p>
<p begin="00:31:12.512" end="00:31:17.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Opinions are like wind.</p>
<p begin="00:31:15.412" end="00:31:20.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And what is your worth? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:31:17.812" end="00:31:22.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A house that stands.</p>
<p begin="00:31:20.712" end="00:31:25.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And what must you never do?</p>
<p begin="00:31:22.912" end="00:31:27.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Never apologize for the space I take in</p>
<p begin="00:31:25.012" end="00:31:27.612" style="s2">this world.</p>
<p begin="00:31:28.712" end="00:31:33.112" style="s2">If someone tries to make you feel small,</p>
<p begin="00:31:30.712" end="00:31:35.812" style="s2">remember this. The people who shame you</p>
<p begin="00:31:33.112" end="00:31:38.112" style="s2">do not own the mirror. You do. Love</p>
<p begin="00:31:35.812" end="00:31:39.912" style="s2">yourself as you are today.</p>
<p begin="00:31:38.112" end="00:31:40.831" style="s2">Let [music] the world catch up when it</p>
<p begin="00:31:39.912" end="00:31:42.851" style="s2">is ready.</p>
<p begin="00:31:40.831" end="00:31:42.851" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:31:51.311" end="00:31:53.331" style="s2">[singing]</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
